OL,3,AWhat are my rights if my flight is
OL,4,Acancelled or delayed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights in Scotland, Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fand northern England have been affected
OL,8,Fby air traffic control issues ` the
OL,9,Fsecond major disruption at UK airports
OL,10,Fin a few weeks.
OL,12,FWhen a flight is cancelled or delayed,
OL,13,Fpassengers affected have various
OL,14,Frights, such as a refund or an
OL,15,Falternative flight at no extra cost.
OL,16,FHowever, these can vary depending on
OL,17,Fwhich carrier you are flying with and
OL,18,Ffrom where.
OL,23,APub: 31-MayQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
