OL,3,AWhat are my rights if my flight is
OL,4,Acancelled or delayed?
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra compensation is payable only when
OL,7,Fan airline is at fault, which is not
OL,8,Fthe case with air traffic control
OL,9,Fproblems.
OL,11,FHere's what it means for you.
